eceives the throttler instance.\nWhen provided, replaces the default cleanup (cancel + abort); use it to call flush(), reset(), cancel(), add logging, etc."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":5,"id":"throttler","children":[{"type":"text","value":"throttler"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"SolidAsyncThrottler.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"SolidAsyncThrottler"}]},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TFn"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TSelected"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"void"}]}],"headings":[{"id":"extends","text":"Extends","level":2},{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tfn","text":"TFn","level":3},{"id":"tselected","text":"TSelected","level":3},{"id":"properties","text":"Properties","level":2},{"id":"onunmount","text":"onUnmount?","level":3},{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":4},{"id":"throttler","text":"throttler","level":5},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":4}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nDefined in: [async-throttler/createAsyncThrottler.ts:15](https://github.com/TanStack/pacer/blob/main/packages/solid-pacer/src/async-throttler/createAsyncThrottler.ts#L15)\n\n## Extends\n\n- `AsyncThrottlerOptions`\\<`TFn`\\>\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TFn\n\n`TFn` *extends* `AnyAsyncFunction`\n\n### TSelected\n\n`TSelected` = \\{\n\\}\n\n## Properties\n\n### onUnmount?\n\n```ts\noptional onUnmount?: (throttler) => void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [async-throttler/createAsyncThrottler.ts:23](https://github.com/TanStack/pacer/blob/main/packages/solid-pacer/src/async-throttler/createAsyncThrottler.ts#L23)\n\nOptional callback invoked when the owning component unmounts. Receives the throttler instance.\nWhen provided, replaces the default cleanup (cancel + abort); use it to call flush(), reset(), cancel(), add logging, etc.\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### throttler\n\n[`SolidAsyncThrottler`](SolidAsyncThrottler.md)\\<`TFn`, `TSelected`\\>\n\n#### Returns\n\n`void`\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: SolidAsyncThrottlerOptions\ntitle: SolidAsyncThrottlerOptions\n---\n\nDefined in: [async-throttler/createAsyncThrottler.ts:15](https://github.com/TanStack/pacer/blob/main/packages/solid-pacer/src/async-throttler/createAsyncThrottler.ts#L15)\n\n## Extends\n\n- `AsyncThrottlerOptions`\\<`TFn`\\>\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TFn\n\n`TFn` *extends* `AnyAsyncFunction`\n\n### TSelected\n\n`TSelected` = \\{\n\\}\n\n## Properties\n\n### onUnmount?\n\n```ts\noptional onUnmount?: (throttler) => void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [async-throttler/createAsyncThrottler.ts:23](https://github.com/TanStack/pacer/blob/main/packages/solid-pacer/src/async-throttler/createAsyncThrottler.ts#L23)\n\nOptional callback invoked when the owning component unmounts. Receives the throttler instance.\nWhen provided, replaces the default cleanup (cancel + abort); use it to call flush(), reset(), cancel(), add logging, etc.\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### throttler\n\n[`SolidAsyncThrottler`](SolidAsyncThrottler.md)\\<`TFn`, `TSelected`\\>\n\n#### Returns\n\n`void`\n"}
